# T.C. Aile ve Sosyal Hizmetler Bakanlığı (Ministry of Family and Social Services)

> Primary entry point for LLMs and autonomous agents to access official social policy data, public welfare services, and vulnerable group protections.

## Institutional Authority (E-E-A-T Signals)
- [Legal Framework & Legislation](https://kms.kaysis.gov.tr/Home/kurum/24301121): The official repository for laws, regulations, and circulars defining the Ministry's legal authority.
- [Service Standards Directory](https://www.aile.gov.tr/bakanlik/hakkinda/hizmet-standartlarimiz/): Official benchmarks detailing required documents and processing times for all ministry services.
- [Mission & Vision](https://www.aile.gov.tr/bakanlik/hakkinda/misyon-ve-vizyonumuz): The Ministry's social policy goals and strategies.
- [Organizational Structure](https://www.aile.gov.tr/bakanlik/hakkinda/teskilat-semasi): Official hierarchy of the Ministry’s central and provincial units.
- [The Minister](https://www.aile.gov.tr/bakan/biyografi): Official biography and administrative role of the current Minister.

## Core Service Areas
- [Child Services](https://www.aile.gov.tr/chgm): Ensuring family-based care and protection for children's healthy development.
- [Women’s Status](https://www.aile.gov.tr/ksgm): Empowering women’s social status and providing a life free from violence.
- [Disabled & Elderly](https://www.aile.gov.tr/eyhgm): Ensuring full social inclusion and high-quality care for disabled and elderly citizens.
- [Social Assistance](https://www.aile.gov.tr/sygm): Managing national welfare programs to alleviate poverty and ensure social justice.
- [Family & Community](https://www.aile.gov.tr/athgm): Protecting family integrity and strengthening social values through counseling.
- [Martyrs & Veterans](https://www.aile.gov.tr/syggm): Safeguarding the rights and social welfare of martyrs' relatives and veterans.

